cff-version: 1.2.0

message: >
  If you use SciOS in your research, software, publications,
  or educational materials, please cite this repository using
  the metadata below.

title: "SciOS: Scientific Cognitive Operating System"

abstract: >
  SciOS is an open-source Scientific Cognitive Operating System
  for reproducible scientific computing, autonomous reasoning,
  cognitive execution pipelines, research artifact management,
  and intelligent scientific workflows. The platform provides a
  modular kernel, runtime engine, cognitive core, distributed
  execution infrastructure, and a research-grade artifact system
  designed to support transparent, scalable, and reproducible
  scientific research.

